    "media:imagetext": "Tokyo, Japan.\nThe better way to fly 18/10/72.\nDear Mr. Barrie James,\nThank you very much, I re-\nceived your letter last day.\nI have not been collecting POST\nCARD that I had collected them\nbefore starting aircraft picture.\nI will be aranging them, but\nyou need some Postc., you make\nmoney send me to buy them. And I\nwill get some airlines postcard\nQUESTION: Meaning postcard\nfor you.\n: What do you want?\n1) Color, 2) Brack \u0026 White\n3) My picture for postcard ?\nWould you please tell me it.\nPostcard price in Japan about\n·50. per one copy.\nI hope contact as soon as\npossible.\nBest Regard,\n50\nAIR MAIL\nPOST CARD\nPAR AVION.\n2\nPON\nMr. Barrie James\nINTERNATIONAL LEUER,\nAl te Hedingerstrasse 69,\n8910 Affoltern Am Albis.\nNIPPON\nSWITZER\n19. 7218:24\nFrom : Kiy\nO1\nSato\n23-4, Nishishimbashi\n1-chome, Minto-ku,\nTokyo, Japan.\n166.103",
